# Build context of the apps/web, apps/api and apps/worker Dockerfiles, which
# are built from the repository root: docker build -f apps/<app>/Dockerfile .
# (kickoff-package.md §8.9). The images install their own dependencies and
# build inside the image, so nothing generated on this machine goes in.

# Version control and local tool state
.git
.claude
.codex
.agents
.scratch
.playwright-mcp
graphify-out
sources

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt in the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local PostgreSQL data (pnpm db:start)
.local

# Secrets: no env file, key or certificate enters an image. `pnpm deploy`
# copies every file of a package that the package's own ignore files do not
# exclude (https://pnpm.io/cli/deploy, "Files copied"), and a local
# `pnpm --filter api --prod deploy --legacy` did copy apps/api/.env, which only
# the repository root .gitignore excludes.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Test output and evidence
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/playwright-report-internal
**/test-results
apps/web/tests/e2e/__screenshots__
docs/**/screenshots

# Planning, research and brand material no image reads (about 300 MB)
docs
phase-0
